Package: google-drive-ubuntu
Version: 1.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, nautilus, python3-nautilus, gir1.2-nautilus-4.1, dbus-x11, xdg-utils, libglib2.0-bin, rclone
Recommends: gnome-terminal
Maintainer: Google Drive Ubuntu Project
Description: Google Drive Client for Ubuntu
 Desktop client for Google Drive on Ubuntu/Linux, built on rclone.
 Includes a GTK4 window, a GTK3 tray icon, a Nautilus extension and
 automatic synchronization driven by a native Rust engine.
 .
 GNOME Online Accounts is not used: GOA 3.58 dropped Drive file
 support, so the account lives in rclone's configuration.
